      "body": "This new declaration path also covers the existing `ATOMG.E.ADD.STRONG.GPU ... desc[UR6][R8.64]` fixture, but only `load_op` and `store_op` call `desc_address_pair_setup`; `atomic_op` formats `[%rd8]` directly. The resulting PTX uses an uninitialized `%rd8` instead of the `{%r8, %r9}` address pair. Add the predicated descriptor setup in `atomic_op` using its computed address index, or diagnose descriptor-address atomics as unsupported.",
