      "body": "Numeric width modifiers are kept in `inst.modifiers` while `data_type` remains unset (`disassembler.rs:539-548` and `SassDataType::from_modifier` does not map `64`/`128`). Consequently `LDG.E.64`/`STG.E.64` (and `.128`) bypass this predicate and fall through to `load_op`/`store_op`, which emit `.u32` instead of rejecting the unsupported wide access. Detect the numeric width modifiers and all data types wider than 32 bits here.",
